    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i hear you on the doctor thing but i just really cant do a hospital bill right now. id really rather just try to manage it with something i can get at a pharmacy. if it is bell's palsy, can i just take some high dose steroids or something to get the swelling down on my own? whats a safe dose of prednisone or something similar i could take to just fix this quickly so i dont have to worry about it?",
